        <mxCell id="eieaO2LlE6_dv7Pf06_k-365" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;margin-block: 0px 0.75rem; padding-inline-start: 1.5rem; color: rgb(199, 199, 199); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(34, 38, 43);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;158&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;158&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Preparación del Nodo:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;179&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Se reserva memoria dinámica para el nuevo nodo (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;228&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;tNodo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;233&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) y para su información. Se copian los datos y se asigna el tamaño (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;301&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;tamInfo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;308&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;309&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;310&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;310&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Búsqueda con el &quot;Dedo&quot;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;333&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Se utiliza un puntero doble (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;363&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;lista&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;368&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) para recorrer las direcciones de los enlaces. El bucle avanza mientras exista un nodo adelante (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;466&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;*lista != NULL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;480&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) y su contenido sea menor al dato nuevo según la función de comparación (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;554&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;cmp &amp;lt; 0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;561&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;562&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;563&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;563&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Frenado Estratégico:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;583&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; El &quot;dedo&quot; se detiene exactamente en la casilla del enganche (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;645&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;sig&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;648&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) del nodo anterior al lugar de inserción. Si la inserción es al principio, se queda apuntando al ancla original&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;760&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;761&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;761&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;La Conexión de Puente:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;783&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;783&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Enganche hacia adelante:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;807&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; El nuevo nodo conecta su campo &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;839&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;sig&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;842&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; a lo que apunta actualmente el dedo (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;880&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;*lista&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;886&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;). Esto lo vincula con el resto de la cadena (o con &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;938&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;NULL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;942&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; si llegó al final)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;961&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;paragraph list-item normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;962&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;962&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Enganche desde atrás:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;983&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Se actualiza el contenido de la casilla que sostiene el dedo (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1046&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Code&amp;quot;; font-size: 0.875rem; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(62, 74, 89); padding: 0.25rem;&quot;&gt;*lista&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1052&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) para que ahora apunte al nuevo nodo. Esto integra el nuevo vagón a la vía de forma definitiva&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-13&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; style=&quot;font: 500 11.008px / 16px &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; letter-spacing: 0.096px; display: inline-flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-radius: 50%; padding: 0px; height: 1.375rem; width: 1.375rem; margin-inline-start: 0.25rem; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(26, 29, 34); color: rgb(171, 171, 171); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1147&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1148&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5rem; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;; margin-block-end: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
